          {
            "name": "get_hedge_portfolio",
            "description": "Returns all open forward contracts and hedges with maturity date, notional amount, contracted rate, and current mark-to-market value. Use this to answer 'what is my current hedge ratio on EUR?' without needing execute permissions. hedges[] is drawdown-normalised: a parent forward is listed once at its remaining notional and child draws are excluded, exactly as the dashboard hedge book counts cover. Also returns coverage (Protection Ratio and over-hedge flag as published by the dashboard), policy_band (hedge-ratio policy band and per-currency status), residual_coverage (net exposure vs active hedge notional per currency), drawdowns (original, drawn and remaining notional per parent) and hedge_mark_to_market.",
            "inputSchema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "entity_id": {
                  "type": "string",
