          {
            "name": "get_transaction_log_summary",
            "description": "Returns a safe read-only transaction-log summary for Explain > Detailed Transaction Logs: top open-invoice unrealised FX rows, settled-invoice realised FX rows, bank/cash rows, counts, and row provenance. Does not expose raw provider payloads, hidden reconciliation notes, credentials, or private calculation internals. Also returns invoice_rows: the ranked (open first, largest base equivalent first) invoice table the in-app Scout assistant reads, home-currency rows included, capped at 80 rows with invoice_rows_total for the true book size.",
            "inputSchema": {
